- Topic: {{ $json.Topic }}
- Topic Description: {{ $json.Topic_Desc }}
- Target Keywords: {{ $json.Keywords }}
- English Level: {{ $json.Level }}
- Key phrases: {{ $json.Hero_Phrase }}

